                                                "sense_id": "6f268eb7-72f5-33fa-9b46-62297a9b2202",
                                                "text": "This imposing structure, which not only carries the single track branch line but also the gas main supplying the Forest of Dean area, cost £200,000 when it was built in 1879, and at its highest point is 70ft above the high-water mark."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "819082cd-2e61-42be-a2e9-28ff1a6fdf20",
                                                "sense_id": "6f268eb7-72f5-33fa-9b46-62297a9b2202",
                                                "text": "Elsewhere, utility diversion works are still scheduled to continue, with work to move a gas main on Drummond Street set to begin in early 2025."
                                            }
